	(text "OOMWOO charging-only dock, v2 (2026-10-27)\n20 V brick in; DOCK+ / DOCK- pogo contacts out (energized only after the robot\nis recognised by its ~130k / ~30 uF signature); 38 kHz NEC IR beacon.\nCH32V003 control (Arduino core, ch32fun, PlatformIO). Refs in the 1000s: each board has its\nown range (main board 1-999, dock 1000s, sensor boards 2000s-6000s)."
